## 主链路请求摘要（供报告引用）

从「商品搜索」到「创建订单」的完整调用链：

| 顺序 | 方法 | URL | 关键请求字段 | 状态码 | 关键响应字段 |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | GET | `/store/products` | `region_id`, `limit` | 200 | `products[].id`, `variants[].calculated_price` |
| 2 | GET | `/store/products?q=` | `q`（搜索词）, `region_id` | 200 | `products[]`（过滤后的结果） |
| 3 | GET | `/store/products/{id}` | `region_id` | 200 | `product.variants[]`, `product.options[]` |
| 4 | POST | `/store/carts` | `region_id`, `sales_channel_id` | 200 | `cart.id` |
| 5 | POST | `/store/carts/{id}/line-items` | `variant_id`, `quantity` | 200 | `cart.items[]`, `cart.total` |
| 6 | POST | `/store/carts/{id}/line-items/{line_id}` | `quantity` | 200 | `cart.items[].quantity` |
| 7 | POST | `/store/carts/{id}/addresses` | `first_name`, `last_name`, `address_1`, `city`, `country_code`, `postal_code` | 200 | `cart.shipping_address`, `cart.billing_address` |
| 8 | GET | `/store/shipping-options` | `cart_id` | 200 | `shipping_options[].id`, `.amount` |
| 9 | POST | `/store/carts/{id}/shipping-methods` | `option_id` | 200 | `cart.shipping_methods[]` |
| 10 | POST | `/store/carts/{id}/payment-sessions` | `provider_id: "pp_system_default"` | 200 | `cart.payment_collection` |
| 11 | POST | `/store/carts/{id}/complete` | — | 200 | `order.id`, `order.display_id` |

**注意**：报告中未粘贴完整的敏感响应体，只记录字段名与关键值。
